Sounds good', 'author_association': 'COLLABORATOR', 'pin': None, 'reactions': {'url': 'https://api.github.com/repos/talonhub/community/issues/comments/1807193391/reactions', 'total_count': 0, '+1': 0, '-1': 0, 'laugh': 0, 'hooray': 0, 'confused': 0, 'heart': 0, 'rocket': 0, 'eyes': 0}, 'performed_via_github_app': None}, {'url': 'https://api.github.com/repos/talonhub/community/issues/comments/1807203509', 'html_url': 'https://github.com/talonhub/community/pull/1305#issuecomment-1807203509', 'issue_url': 'https://api.github.com/repos/talonhub/community/issues/1305', 'id': 1807203509, 'node_id': 'IC_kwDODlDwxc5rt7y1', 'user': {'login': 'AndreasArvidsson', 'id': 3511326, 'node_id': 'MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTEzMjY=', 'avatar_url': 'https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3511326?v=4', 'gravatar_id': '', 'url': 'https://api.github.com/users/AndreasArvidsson', 'html_url': 'https://github.com/AndreasArvidsson', 'followers_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/AndreasArvidsson/followers', 'following_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/AndreasArvidsson/following{/other_user}', 'gists_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/AndreasArvidsson/gists{/gist_id}', 'starred_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/AndreasArvidsson/starred{/owner}{/repo}', 'subscriptions_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/AndreasArvidsson/subscriptions', 'organizations_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/AndreasArvidsson/orgs', 'repos_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/AndreasArvidsson/repos', 'events_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/AndreasArvidsson/events{/privacy}', 'received_events_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/AndreasArvidsson/received_events', 'type': 'User', 'user_view_type': 'public', 'site_admin': False}, 'created_at': '2023-11-12T18:25:21Z', 'updated_at': '2023-11-12T18:25:21Z', 'body': '@pokey Updated: We now send the wrapper variable', 'author_association': 'COLLABORATOR', 'pin': None, 'reactions': {'url': 'https://api.github.com/repos/talonhub/community/issues/comments/1807203509/reactions', 'total_count': 0, '+1': 0, '-1': 0, 'laugh': 0, 'hooray': 0, 'confused': 0, 'heart': 0, 'rocket': 0, 'eyes': 0}, 'performed_via_github_app': None}, {'url': 'https://api.github.com/repos/talonhub/community/issues/comments/1814286932', 'html_url': 'https://github.com/talonhub/community/pull/1305#issuecomment-1814286932', 'issue_url': 'https://api.github.com/repos/talonhub/community/issues/1305', 'id': 1814286932, 'node_id': 'IC_kwDODlDwxc5sI9JU', 'user': {'login': 'pokey', 'id': 755842, 'node_id': 'MDQ6VXNlcjc1NTg0Mg==', 'avatar_url': 'https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/755842?v=4', 'gravatar_id': '', 'url': 'https://api.github.com/users/pokey', 'html_url': 'https://github.com/pokey', 'followers_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/pokey/followers', 'following_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/pokey/following{/other_user}', 'gists_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/pokey/gists{/gist_id}', 'starred_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/pokey/starred{/owner}{/repo}', 'subscriptions_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/pokey/subscriptions', 'organizations_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/pokey/orgs', 'repos_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/pokey/repos', 'events_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/pokey/events{/privacy}', 'received_events_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/pokey/received_events', 'type': 'User', 'user_view_type': 'public', 'site_admin': False}, 'created_at': '2023-11-16T11:45:20Z', 'updated_at': '2023-11-16T11:45:20Z', 'body': 'We had an idea for a better api for this, where community just has actions

```py
@dataclass
class InsertionSnippet:
    body: str;
    scopes: str[];

@dataclass
class WrapperSnippet:
    body: str;
    variableName: str[];
    scope: str;

@mod.actions
class Snippet:
    get_insertion_snippet(name: str) -> InsertionSnippet:
        ...
    get_wrapper_snippet(name: str) -> WrapperSnippet:
        ...
```

